---
title: "Foundation lint: a finding, and how the run exits"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: read
    lg2: warn
    lg3: fail
    lg4: clear
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 yellow
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 teal
  s0: Nothing read yet
  s1: Records read from the venture
  s2: A rule fired, warning only
  s3: Clean venture, no finding
  s4: Missing or malformed record skipped
  s5: A rule fired, set to fail
  s6: Exited with no failure
  s7: Exited failed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: read the records through venture files
  s1 --> s2: a rule fires as a warning
  s1 --> s3: judge a clean venture
  s1 --> s4: skip a missing or malformed record
  s1 --> s5: a rule fires and its mode is fail closed
  s2 --> s6: exit 0
  s3 --> s6: exit 0
  s4 --> s6: exit 0
  s5 --> s7: exit 1
  class s0 tan
  class s1 blue
  class s2 yellow
  class s3 teal
  class s4 teal
  class s5 orange
  class s6 teal
  class s7 orange
